      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Corrigan%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "By 1882, 17 sawmills operated in the Corrigan area, turning the town into a timber‑industry hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Corrigan%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A post office opened in Corrigan in 1883, marking its emergence as a formal community.",
