      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Corrigan%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The timber boom led to churches, stores, hotels, and gins opening, shaping Corrigan’s early social fabric.",
